<div class="prose"><h2>Information collection</h2><p>This website does not offer user accounts or accept form submissions. It does not intentionally ask visitors to provide personal information.</p><h2>Website analytics</h2><p>We use Google Analytics to understand general website usage, such as pages visited, approximate location, device type, and referral source. Google may set cookies or receive technical information from your browser to provide this service. The Chapter uses these reports to improve the website and does not use them to identify individual visitors.</p><p>You can learn more about <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a> and manage analytics preferences through your browser or Google’s available controls.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>The council map loads map tiles from OpenStreetMap. Links to Google Maps, the Knights of Columbus, and the California State Council lead to external websites governed by their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Future changes</h2><p>This notice will be updated when the website’s information practices or services change.</p></div>
